<title>CHINA: HAECO H1 net edges up to HK$179.6 mln.</title>
<headline>HAECO H1 net edges up to HK$179.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (H.K. cents)	 97.0    vs 97.0</p>
<p> Dividend (H.K. cents)  26.0    vs 26.0</p>
<p> Exceptional items	nil     vs nil</p>
<p> Net			  179.6   vs 178.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,071.0 vs 1,189.6</p>
<p> Company name	     Hong Kong Aircraft Engineering Co Ltd</p>
<p> Books close		Sept 15-19</p>
<p> Dividend payable	 Sept 29</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is engaged in the overhaul and maintenance of commercial aircraft.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
